rdens and eat their fruit.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Amos 4:9","note":"“I struck you with blight and mildew many times in your gardens and your vineyards; and the swarming locusts have devoured your fig trees and your olive trees…","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H1594","lemma":"גִּנָּה","transliteration":"ginnah","gloss":"garden"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}